"как фоновый хук. Подробнее: :ref:`консольные хелперы "
"<citeck_console_helpers>`."
msgstr ""
"Automatically injects the ``$`` and ``$$`` objects into the page context "
"on every load. Does not add an entry to the search bar — works only as a "
"background hook. See also: :ref:`console helpers "
"<citeck_console_helpers>`."

